    "CoiStatement": "Y.Z., B.M.L., and F.E.R. have filed a patent application based on the use of Cas9 for enforced retention of the UBP. Y.Z. and F.E.R. have filed a patent application for the truncated transporter. F.E.R. has a financial interest (shares) in Synthorx Inc., a company that has commercial interests in the UBP. The other authors declare no other competing financial interests.",
